'''Santa''' is a [[common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2017 Christmas box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2017|2017 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance==
Its blade is bright red with a brown belt that has a golden buckle, and a white patch on the tip resembling Santa’s beard. The guard is white, and the handle is solid black.

